WEBVTT

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.650
Distribution Spot Films

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:30.380
It's a prank!

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:14.700
FASENDEIRO, BRAZILIAN VERSION SIGMA

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:36.400
There is no doubt about it. Someone is stealing our emergency supplies.

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:39.100
How to solve it? By catching the guy.

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:41.620
When I find out who did it, I'll kill him.

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:47.200
Amore, are you okay?

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:52.420
We need to do something. The river is sinking. We won't have the necessary food.

00:01:52.740 --> 00:01:55.700
I'll take care of it. I'll do a complete search from house to house.

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:57.940
I'll frame all the suspicious types in the neighborhood.

00:01:58.900 --> 00:01:59.980
No, let's not talk about...

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.700
We will not say anything about it. If the other animals know, they may panic.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:08.820
This drought that can turn the forest into a desert has already scared everyone.

00:02:09.930 --> 00:02:11.930
Kimba, that's right, we're not going to say anything.

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:15.440
Then we will have the opportunity to support the channel in flagrant.

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:17.960
Right, you will keep an eye on the food.

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:19.240
Right!

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:35.620
Tell me, you lazy idiot! Wake up! Wake up! Wake up!

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:38.360
I'm waking up, waking up.

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:40.320
I'm done, my little flower. Now it's your turn!

00:02:41.030 --> 00:02:41.610
Oh, all right.

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:43.850
Now it's my turn to sleep!

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:50.450
Oh, don't worry, sir. Thank you very much, Polly. Wake me up when it's my turn to sleep.

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:07.140
What are you doing, Daniel?

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:09.010
It's the rain dance.

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:13.790
Humans do this when there's a storm.

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:14.350
Hey, Tim!

00:03:15.350 --> 00:03:17.430
At least I'm making some wind.

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:20.010
Daniel, it's better to leave this dance to the humans.

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:24.900
So, Kimba, it's time to distribute the emergency food.

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:27.380
Me and Tim went there and were surprised

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:29.680
when we found out that most of it had already been eaten.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:34.740
Please, Mrs. Hippopotamus, don't worry. It will be enough for everyone.

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:36.240
Mom, I'm hungry.

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:39.150
See what will happen if everyone knows?

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:44.450
Correct me if I'm wrong, because I think you would make me go to work watching you if you stayed awake.

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:48.550
Actually, I think it would be essential. You let us steal from under your nose.

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:50.350
Excuse me.

00:03:51.150 --> 00:03:54.230
Oh, don't be a big lazy, because I, I...

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:58.500
Why are you so nervous, Polly? Does it have to do with all your emergency food?

00:03:58.860 --> 00:03:59.720
You can believe that.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:00.980
Someone is robbing them!

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:07.780
What did he say? There's no more food for us?

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:18.510
I left the cat!

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:20.510
And how could you?

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:29.510
There's food here!

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:32.160
We can't touch this food!

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:35.260
Okay, and let them steal it from us. It's crazy!

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:38.300
I say we must eat it before it's too late.

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:39.960
Don't be fools!

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:42.820
You can't stop us. The food belongs to all of us.

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:44.380
You're right, Samson. It does.

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:46.780
I have to feed everyone when the time comes.

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:50.380
But I'm in charge of it and I say that the time has not yet come.

00:04:56.950 --> 00:04:58.770
How can it be so, your heart?

00:04:59.150 --> 00:04:59.970
Take a look at the...

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:03.000
The poor little thing is going up for food.

00:05:05.084 --> 00:05:08.804
I think we can hold on a little longer if Kimba says we need to.

00:05:08.828 --> 00:05:09.828
What?

00:05:09.828 --> 00:05:10.828
Thank you, Timmy.

00:05:10.828 --> 00:05:11.828
How about this?

00:05:11.828 --> 00:05:13.828
Can we be as brave as Timmy?

00:05:15.324 --> 00:05:19.164
I know it's hard, but if the rain doesn't come soon, this food is our hope.

00:05:19.356 --> 00:05:21.356
We have to make it last!

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:46.680
Now we'll have less food to eat.

00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:53.810
Let's keep the hopes even if things seem bad.

00:05:54.150 --> 00:05:55.830
Look at that big tree.

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:57.200
It's still standing.

00:05:57.480 --> 00:05:59.660
Proud and strong despite everything.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.000
Your return is destroyed.

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:04.300
We must do the same, Kimba!

00:06:04.636 --> 00:06:06.296
You know the words, Daniel.

00:06:06.428 --> 00:06:10.128
We must preserve, even against the insanity of humans.

00:06:10.128 --> 00:06:10.628
What?

00:06:10.908 --> 00:06:16.208
This must have been done by them, they often burn the jungle to build their farms.

00:06:16.284 --> 00:06:18.284
Daniel, you gave me an idea!

00:06:20.796 --> 00:06:24.796
We can reverse this disaster in our favor by building a farm.

00:06:24.796 --> 00:06:26.796
That way we'll always have food.

00:06:26.844 --> 00:06:29.984
Yes, but we must know that even if we start today, it will take...

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:31.880
There were many moons until the farm produced enough.

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:35.340
That's right. What are we going to eat in the meantime?

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:36.520
I'm hungry.

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:38.370
Me too.

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:41.390
Quentus, please.

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:45.420
We need to start planning the future, even if we're hungry.

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:47.040
What?

00:06:49.460 --> 00:06:53.580
Listen, I'm ready to leave this jungle, Kimba.

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:55.200
Good idea. I'm going with you.

00:06:55.800 --> 00:06:59.340
The zebras were smart. They made the bags and left a long time ago.

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:01.690
I don't want to be a zebra!

00:07:01.890 --> 00:07:02.330
Huh?

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:07.050
Lystras, are you okay?

00:07:07.270 --> 00:07:09.510
Where are the other zebras, Lystras?

00:07:09.730 --> 00:07:10.820
What happened?

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:12.920
We left the jungle!

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:29.450
You still want to leave this jungle?

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:33.290
It's the worst out there. That's why we have to stick together.

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:36.550
If we want to build a farm, we'll all need you.

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:44.210
This farm of yours can produce enough food for bigger animals, like Tiny and me.

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:44.980
Yes, ma'am.

00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:46.830
Come on, Hippo, there will be food for everyone!

00:07:47.090 --> 00:07:51.050
Then I'll go back to the plan of Kimba. We need to start thinking about the future.

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:52.770
Very good, Mr. Hippo!

00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:56.110
All please follow me. I know a good place for a farm.

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:03.360
They don't think a farm comes out of nowhere, they think...

00:08:03.360 --> 00:08:04.000
Let's go!

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:05.310
That's right, Captain!

00:08:06.470 --> 00:08:07.530
Yeah, that's right.

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:51.780
We have to do something.

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:56.620
How many seeds did you get?

00:08:57.500 --> 00:08:58.280
It's already something.

00:09:16.650 --> 00:09:21.630
They're all exhausted and I can't take care of them, so we're going to need more help.

00:09:22.610 --> 00:09:24.250
Well, bring some elephants!

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:25.810
That's a good idea!

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:29.060
Bring elephants, they're never close when we need them.

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:37.030
And they're always playing hide and seek when it's time to go to work

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:38.440
Oh, if you want!

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:03.640
You're a pig! You're a pig! You're a pig!

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:07.260
We can't force you to build a farm, pig!

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:10.600
Farms are a problem.

00:10:12.190 --> 00:10:13.450
I'll do anything, you bastard!

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:16.950
It was nothing. See you later.

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:23.240
You're sick!

00:10:23.820 --> 00:10:27.000
I need to confess something, Book. I did something wrong.

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:29.900
Did you see...

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:37.750
Thanks to the seed that Daniel gathered and planted, we have enough for a harvest, but we will need much more before this farm is produced.

00:10:38.870 --> 00:10:40.870
Let's gather as many seeds as we can.

00:10:41.550 --> 00:10:42.790
Kiba, it's Reda!

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:43.890
Reda, what happened to the javelin?

00:10:44.650 --> 00:10:45.630
Bebe, she's sick!

00:10:50.570 --> 00:10:53.890
Bucky told me she's not feeling well, and I brought some food.

00:10:54.390 --> 00:10:58.760
But it will never get better, otherwise...

00:10:58.760 --> 00:10:59.870
What happened?

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:02.360
I thought that the boar was always hungry.

00:11:03.380 --> 00:11:06.820
I feel guilty eating.

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:11.860
I hope Prince Kiba is giving his part of the supplement so you can eat.

00:11:12.280 --> 00:11:13.960
Polly promised not to say anything.

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:16.880
Oh, Kimba, now I'm feeling even worse than before.

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:19.660
All right, Reda, don't worry about me.

00:11:28.150 --> 00:11:29.970
Continue giving your part of the food to...

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:34.180
You need more than I do. I'm fine. Don't worry.

00:11:34.760 --> 00:11:37.400
All animals depend on you, Kimba. You can't...

00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:39.920
I'm fine, Polly. It's true. I've never felt better.

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:46.240
Let's go to the funeral.

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:53.140
You got worse?

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:57.780
I can't let you go on. There's something I need to tell you, Kimba.

00:11:57.920 --> 00:11:59.380
What is it, Reda?

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:02.790
I'm the one who was stealing the emergency food supplement.

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:09.670
I was weak and sick, but that doesn't justify it.

00:12:09.730 --> 00:12:12.270
You can forgive me, Kimba. I'll give it all back, I swear.

00:12:13.510 --> 00:12:15.950
When the others find out about it, it'll be a disaster!

00:12:16.470 --> 00:12:20.370
They won't know, because what's done is done and she's repentant.

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:22.360
Let's forgive and forget, right?

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:28.720
Say a word about it to the others, until Reda has a chance to apologize.

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:29.960
My dick is...

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:34.300
Do you feel better now that you've taken this off your head?

00:12:34.800 --> 00:12:37.880
Now, my food is almost over.

00:12:39.770 --> 00:12:41.290
That's out of the question.

00:12:42.130 --> 00:12:46.400
But Daniel, Red is in need. The poor poor thing is weak and sick.

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:49.640
No, Kimba, we're almost out of food and very nervous.

00:12:49.940 --> 00:12:51.760
Without you wanting to take even more.

00:12:52.440 --> 00:12:54.060
Don't worry, make up the difference.

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:57.600
We can't get enough seeds for the plantation, what will we get for food?

00:12:57.960 --> 00:12:59.060
I'll look for the jungle.

00:12:59.460 --> 00:12:59.860
I don't know.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:03.600
Don't be ridiculous, it's very dangerous, hyenas roaming all over the jungle.

00:13:03.940 --> 00:13:05.360
I can take care of myself.

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:10.060
I'm afraid you're forcing me to bring your secret to the open sky.

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:12.380
I know everything about Hedda and what she did.

00:13:12.480 --> 00:13:14.820
The chimpanzee brothers that I saw when she confessed.

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:19.820
If the others find out that you take their food to deliver to a thief,

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:22.740
well, I don't need to say, they may get a little annoyed.

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:24.100
This to be optimistic.

00:13:24.540 --> 00:13:27.400
Maybe if you fed her with your part of the food.

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:29.860
You're the great Pasparo, what do you think he's gonna do?

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:31.540
Look, it's time for us to go.

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:36.140
This is gratitude for you, great friend you, that's all I'm going to say.

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:41.890
I think I'll have to take more of my own stock.

00:13:42.190 --> 00:13:47.660
Little thing that had left over.

00:13:47.920 --> 00:13:54.170
Oh, thank you, Kimba. How can I thank you?

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:56.460
Stay well.

00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:14.650
And the others find out that you take their food to deliver to a thief.

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:16.160
Don't be ridiculous.

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:19.240
There are hyenas surrounded by the jungle.

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:20.700
It's very dangerous.

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:26.080
Don't do that, Gimba.

00:14:26.180 --> 00:14:28.600
I have no choice. I need to leave the jungle.

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:29.880
Maybe I'll find more...

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:32.340
Food and seeds in another place. I need to at least try.

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:46.000
Things are getting worse here.

00:14:47.450 --> 00:14:58.210
What is Kim doing here?

00:14:58.430 --> 00:14:59.970
I don't know, but he...

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:00.600
You're going to regret it.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.980
Everything is dry, maybe beyond the trees.

00:15:32.220 --> 00:15:37.940
Everything is dry and dead.

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:41.090
When is it going to rain?

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:45.650
Will Kiba's facility work with you?

00:15:47.110 --> 00:15:48.930
But it happens that we are in trouble.

00:15:48.970 --> 00:15:52.010
Besides, if he is so smart,

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:55.350
why couldn't he find the thief who was stealing our supplies?

00:15:55.710 --> 00:15:58.190
For your information, he did it!

00:15:58.470 --> 00:15:59.820
But Kiba made me...

00:16:00.280 --> 00:16:05.600
I don't want to tell anyone. I'd like to tell you, believe me, but stop and believe that I keep your promises.

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:07.300
Hulk also knows everything!

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:08.920
What do I know everything about?

00:16:09.470 --> 00:16:10.650
The secret, you know!

00:16:10.890 --> 00:16:11.430
Shut up!

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:16.830
Sorry, but we swear never to say that the thief is no other than...

00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:23.100
I know who the thief is, let me talk.

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:24.940
You know who the thief is?

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:26.560
Shut up, let her talk!

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:29.940
Poor Kimba, he gives me every piece of your...

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:36.280
own food. Although I do not deserve it. Come, I am the thief, but even when

00:16:36.280 --> 00:16:41.000
Kimba discovered, he forgave me and fed me. I was sick and he helped me

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:41.480
get well.

00:16:41.720 --> 00:16:51.600
They complain about him when he is only risking his life for our cause!

00:16:51.980 --> 00:16:58.920
Poor Kimba! He wants more than all of you who call yourselves friends, your ingrates, your ingrates!

00:17:03.920 --> 00:17:07.000
Wait a minute!

00:17:07.300 --> 00:17:10.400
We're wasting time! I'm going out to help Kimba!

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:11.480
Does anyone want to come with me?

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:12.700
What's right, what's wrong...

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:12.860
Hey!

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:19.300
Wait for me! Wait for me!

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:59.700
I told you, it's better to carry it, okay?

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:12.600
Help! Thank you, young lion!

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:17.520
I wanted to help. By the way, could you help me with a little problem I have?

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:18.760
It would be a pleasure.

00:18:19.340 --> 00:18:21.850
To meet you.

00:18:24.430 --> 00:18:26.770
Seed, what happened to her? They disappeared!

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:29.810
Sorry, I think I have a horrible tendency to swallow.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.680
Things are in my mouth right away.

00:18:31.680 --> 00:18:32.780
Can we try again?

00:18:33.220 --> 00:18:34.620
I promise not to do this again.

00:18:34.720 --> 00:18:35.440
Okay, fine.

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:35.920
Great!

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:02.000
I'm going to die!!!

00:20:02.000 --> 00:20:04.200
Oh, my God!

00:20:08.710 --> 00:20:09.110
Dedele!

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:22.430
Go to the land of the living, Kimba!

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:27.180
Our farm will be ready if it rains.

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:29.960
Pelican was with the seed. If he can get it...

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:30.320
Did you get it?

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:34.480
I did, and you too, thanks to your friend Reda.

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:36.820
Take a look here, your dreams have come true.

00:20:37.300 --> 00:20:50.490
It may be just a guess, but I think it's going to rain.

00:21:13.240 --> 00:21:13.400
Guys!
